    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n41829" root="ورث" body-key="w">
    
      4 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اورثهُ الشَّىْءَ</span></b>  <i>He</i> (his father) <i>made him to
inherit the thing.</i> (S.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اورثهُ إِيرَاثًا حَسَنًا</span> <i>He
made him to have a goodly inheritance.</i> (TA.)
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اورثهُ الإِرْثَ</span>, and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">المِيرَاثَ</span>, and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">إِيَّاهْ</span> ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ورّثهُ</span></b> , <i>He made
him to inherit the heritage.</i> (A.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اورثهُ</span> and
↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ورثّهُ</span></b>  <i>He</i> (his father) <i>made him to be one of his
heirs.</i> (K.) [See also 2.] ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b4-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اورث وَلَدَهُ</span> <i>He
made his son sole heir.</i> (AZ.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b5-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اورثهُ شَيْئًا</span> (tropical:)  <i>It
occasioned him, as its result, a thing.</i> Ex. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اورثه</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">المَرَضُ ضَعْفًا</span> (tropical:)  <i>The disease occasioned him, as its
result, weakness.</i> (TA.)

